Description: Provides functions to calculate the Surface Temperature (Ts) from geospatial raster data. 
    These functions use albedo, Normalized Difference Vegetation Index (NDVI), and air temperature (Ta) 
    to estimate Ts, facilitating hydrological, ecological, and remote sensing analyses.
